{"GREETING","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,3",{"Hello - keep your distance from the infected - aim for the head if one gets near","Good to see someone alive - stay sharp - don't get bitten","Evening, folks should be indoors, they're not human, those things - don't forget that","Hello, if you've got a weapon, keep it handy - fight for your life"}},
