{"GREETING","reg=gang|st=friendly,neutral",{"What's up - you looking for somebody?","Yo - who let you walk up on us like that? Relax, I'm playing - mostly"}},
{"GREETING","reg=club|st=friendly,neutral",{"Hey, {g:brother|sister}, cold one?"}},
