{"GREETING","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Oh! oh- hi, hi, you scared me, you scared the hell out of me","Hello? hello, hi, are you real? you're real, okay, hi","H-hey, hey there, don't shoot, I'm not armed, I mean, I'm armed, but I'm not going to use it","Hi... hi, hello, sorry, I'm a little jumpy, a lot jumpy","Hey! hey, thank God, another person, hi, I'm- hi","Hello there, hello, it's good to see a face, any face, even a stranger's","Oh my gosh, a person, an actual living person, hi!","Hi, I- sorry, I forgot how to talk to people, gimme a second","AAH- oh my God, you scared the SHIT out of me!!","Oh- oh- hi- hi- sorry- sorry- you startled me, I thought you were one of THEM","Whoa- WHOA- don't sneak up on people like that!!","Hey- hey- jeez- hello- my heart's going a mile a minute","JESUS, you almost gave me a heart attack, hello","Hi- hi- ugh- don't DO that- okay- hello"}},
{"GREETING","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Hey, hey there, keep your hands where I can see them, friend","Hello, stranger, you picked a fine day for a walk","Morning, afternoon, evening, whatever it is, hello","Well, hello, hello yourself, what brings you out here?","Howdy, you lost? you look lost","Hey, you're alive, good, that makes two of us","Evening, if that's what it is, I lose track","Hi there, quiet day, isn't it? the best kind","Damn","Heh, you scared me","Hell, don't do that.."},false,false,{[9]={{t="you move quiet",afterMs=2000},{t="hello",afterMs=2500}},[10]={{t="don't tell anybody",afterMs=2200}},[11]={{t="hello",afterMs=2200}}}},
{"GREETING","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Hey, you! come here, sit down, I'm so glad to see you","Hello, my friend! how are you holding up? you look tired","Hi, hi, good to see you again, I was worried!","There you are! I was just thinking about you, honest","Well, if it isn't my favorite survivor, hello, hello","HEY!! hey, you!! oh thank GOD, it's you!!","You're alive!! you're ALIVE!! come here, come HERE","Oh my God, I thought- never mind, never mind, hi, hi!!"}},
{"GREETING","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Stop right there, state your business!!","Hello, I guess, don't come any closer","Hi, and keep your hands where I can see them","I see you, I see you, keep your distance","Easy... easy","Mm-hm","Don't do that","Stop","I'm watching your hands","Keep it slow, friend","Whoa, whoa, easy, easy, I've got a- stay back","Hi, before you take another step, roll up your sleeves - both arms - will you do that?"},false,{[12]="SHOW_ARMS"},{[5]={{t="I see you, I see you, stay where you are",afterMs=2800}},[6]={{t="I don't like being caught by surprise",afterMs=2800}},[7]={{t="don't walk up on me like that",afterMs=2500}},[8]={{t="right there",afterMs=2500},{t="okay, now, hello",afterMs=2800}},[9]={{t="hello, by the way",afterMs=2800}},[10]={{t="slow and easy, and I won't panic!",afterMs=2800}}}},
{"GREETING","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|hour=5,10",{"Morning! if you can call it that, you're up early, I'm up earlier","Morning, sunshine... or whatever you are, hey","Morning, you look like I feel, rough, but upright","Good morning"},false,false,{[4]={{t="you're up with the birds",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"GREETING","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|hour=11,18",{"Afternoon, friend, long day, isn't it, and it's only half done","Hey there, hot out here, isn't it? find some shade, take a breath","Hello, hello, you're out and about in the middle of the day, brave","Afternoon"},false,false,{[4]={{t="hot, isn't it?",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"GREETING","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|hour=19,21",{"Evening, you're cutting it close, you'd better find shelter soon","Hello, hello, sun's going down, the real day is about to begin, the one we don't like","Evening, friend, heading in for the night? so am I"}},
{"GREETING","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|hour=22,4",{"Shh... hello, it's the middle of the night, talk low...","Hey, hey, you're awake, too, can't sleep? same here","Hi- hi, whisper, whisper, I'm sorry, I thought I was the only one up","Shh -- hello, keep your voice low..."},false,false,{[4]={{t="it's late, and the night has ears",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"GREETING","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral",{"Peace be with you... friend -- come in, come in, there's a seat for you","Peace be with you, friend","Welcome, welcome","Bless you for coming","Hello there, child","Good to see you standing","Peace be with you, friend, come in, come in, there's room in the Lord's house for all","Welcome, child, whatever you've done, whatever you've seen, you are welcome here","Peace be with you, stranger, and welcome, whoever you are"},false,false,{[2]={{t="come in out of the heat",afterMs=3000}},[3]={{t="there's always a pew, and there's always water",afterMs=3200}},[4]={{t="I was just thinking I'd said every prayer I knew",afterMs=3000}},[5]={{t="you look like you've been walking all night",afterMs=3200}},[6]={{t="I count that as a small miracle these days",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"GREETING","role=militia|st=friendly,neutral",{"Hold up, hello, friendly or not? say something","Hey -- friend","Halt a second","Hello, neighbor, we're just a few folks protecting what's ours","Howdy, friend, guns at the ready, but we're friendly"},false,false,{[2]={{t="you headed my way, or away?",afterMs=3200}},[3]={{t="identify yourself, and we'll get along fine",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"GREETING","role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"Hello, you look pale, are you alright? any fever? let me look at you","Hello, you look pale, are you alright? sit if you need to","Hi... hi, are you hurt? are you hungry? let's start there...","You're pale as a sheet, when'd you last eat? Sit, let me look at you","Hey, let me see your hands, I check everybody, it's habit","Hello - before anything else, any bites, any scratches? No? Okay - hi"}},
{"GREETING","role=rescue_firefighter|st=friendly,neutral",{"Hey... hey there -- everything okay? anyone hurt?","Hey there","Well, look at that","Hey. Good to see somebody who wants to talk","Hey, you need something? You can tell me","Hey, anybody hurt? No? Then hi - sorry, habit"},false,false,{[2]={{t="you need a hand with anything?",afterMs=3200}},[3]={{t="a civilian, walking, upright, no bites",afterMs=3000},{t="that's a good day",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"GREETING","role=family_elder|st=friendly,neutral",{"Why hello there, young one, come closer, I don't bite, I haven't bitten anyone in years","Well, bless your heart, come here where I can see you","Oh, honey, a face! a real, live face!","Evening, young one","Why... hello there","Hello, dear","Well, bless my soul, a visitor, come closer, my eyes aren't what they were","Evening, young one, mind your step, everything's rotten around here","Hello, hello, you wouldn't happen to have a peppermint, would you? No? Pity","Why, hello there, I'm Ruth, don't be shy, sit down, you look like you've walked a hundred miles","Well, hello, come on up out of the sun before you fall over"},false,false,{[2]={{t="my eyes aren't what they were",afterMs=3000}},[3]={{t="sit down, you look worn to a thread",afterMs=3000}},[4]={{t="mind the step, it wobbles",afterMs=3200}},[5]={{t="I thought I'd talked to the last person on earth, and it was the cat",afterMs=3000}},[6]={{t="you remind me of my grandson",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"GREETING","role=family_youth|st=friendly,neutral",{"Hi!! Oh my God, a PERSON, another actual person!!","Oh my God, hi!!","Hey, whoa, hey","Hi!!","Yo, hey","Hey, hey, wait, don't go, I'm friendly, really, I'm friendly","Hi!! Hi, um, are you with the Army? Are you a soldier?","Hey, you got any gum? Sorry, hi, hi, I'm Tyler, sorry","Hi, I'm not supposed to talk to strangers, but you seem okay, so, hi","Uh, hey, are you from the Army? No? Okay - hey anyway"},false,false,{[2]={{t="wow- haven't seen anyone my age in days",afterMs=2800}},[3]={{t="you're real -- right? you're a real person?",afterMs=2800}},[4]={{t="hi, hi, hi",afterMs=2500},{t="okay, I'm calm",afterMs=2500}},[5]={{t="don't freak out, I'm cool",afterMs=2800}}}},
{"GREETING","role=civilian_loner|st=friendly,neutral",{"Hmph, hello, don't talk too loud","Hmph","Evening","Hey","Well","Howdy","Hm","Don't say much, don't plan to, but hello","Hm, another one, hello, don't stay long"},false,false,{[2]={{t="...morning, I guess",afterMs=2500}},[3]={{t="quiet now, sound carries",afterMs=2800}},[4]={{t="you walk loud, you know that?",afterMs=2500}},[5]={{t="you're alive",afterMs=2800},{t="good for you",afterMs=2500}},[6]={{t="I'm not much for talking, but I'll make an exception",afterMs=2800}},[7]={{t="another one",afterMs=2500},{t="sit down, if you're staying",afterMs=2500}}}},
{"GREETING","role=family_man,family_woman|st=friendly,neutral",{"Hello, we're just trying to get by, we don't want any trouble","Hi, hello, hi","Hello there","Hello there, friend, you traveling alone? You look like you could use a meal"},false,false,{[2]={{t="the baby just went to sleep, please, keep it down",afterMs=2800}},[3]={{t="sorry if I look frazzled, I haven't slept in a week",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"GREETING","role=rescue_medical|st=careful",{"Hello, and please don't touch anything"}},
{"GREETING","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good,best",{"Well, look who it is! come here, come here, sit, I'm so glad to see you","Hey, you! I was hoping you'd come by, I was just telling somebody about you","There's my favorite person, hello, hello, how are you holding up?","Oh, thank God, a friendly face, YOUR face, come on in, you're always welcome","Hey, hey, you're back, I'm so happy, I was starting to worry","Hi! it's good to see you, it's really good, I mean it","You look tired, come sit, I've got something warm, come on!","Hello, my friend, you've got no idea how much I needed to see you today","Hey, it's you, you're alright, you're alive, I knew it","Well, hello there, stranger, I mean friend, I mean you know what I mean","Look at you, still kicking, I'm so glad, come say hello properly","Hi, hi, folks around here talk about you, good things, don't let it go to your head","Hey there, I heard you were around, I hoped you'd stop by","Oh, it's you, thank goodness, I thought it was trouble","Welcome back, welcome back, you're a sight for sore eyes","Hello, hello, good to see somebody I can trust","Hey you, come give me a hand, I mean come say hi, hi, hello","Hi there, nice to see you, I mean that, truly nice","You're one of the good ones, I tell everybody that, hello","Hey, friend, you look like you've had a day, come on, tell me!!","It's you! the one everybody talks about, hi, I'm glad to finally say it","Well, hello! I've got a seat with your name on it","There you are, I was starting to think you'd forgotten about us","Hey, hey, you're safe, that's the best news I've had all day","Hello, my dear, my friend, my lifesaver, come here","Ah, there's a face I trust, hello, hello!","Evening, morning, whatever, it's you, so it's a good one","Hi, hi, come on over, no need to be shy, we like you here","You made it -- I'm so relieved, hello, hello","Hey! hey, good to see you, you're a good egg, you know that?"}},
{"GREETING","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful,neutral|rep=bad,worst",{"Oh... It's you","Well, well, LOOK what the cat dragged in!","I heard you were around, I was hoping I was wrong","What do you want?","Keep your distance, I know who you are","Hello... Don't expect me to be nice","You've got a nerve showing your face around here","Not you AGAIN!!","Ugh, great, you're HERE!","I know your reputation, and I don't like it","Stop right there, I've heard about you","Oh, look, it's the one everybody warns each other about","Hello, and goodbye, if you're smart","Hmph... I don't talk to people like you","Keep walking, nothing for you here","What are you doing here? who let you in?","I remember what you did, don't think I forgot","Hi... Now go","Stay BACK -- I'm watching you","You? Really? Now? Here? Unbelievable!!","I don't want any trouble, so don't cause any!","There's the one I've been hearing about, charming, I'm sure","Yeah, yeah, hello, whatever, say what you want","I'm not saying hello to you","You should be careful what you do around me!!","Oh God, it's you, great","Let's be clear, I don't like you, and I don't trust you","You AGAIN? Haven't you done enough?","Hello, stranger, hello, devil, whichever you are","Greetings, I guess, now what do you want?","What's your business? make it short"}},
{"GREETING","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=recent_zombie_contact",{"Shh- shh, hi, hi, quiet, there's some close, I just saw","Hey- no- don't shout, they're right over there, keep it down","Oh thank God, a person, a LIVE person, get down, get low","Hi, hi, don't move too fast, something's out there, I heard it","Hello, hello, whisper, please, whisper, they're near","Hi! Quick, get over here, behind me, behind me","Oh- you scared me- they're out there, okay? they're close","Hello, hello, forget the pleasantries, we've got company","Hey, shush, they just went by, I'm still shaking","Hi, sorry, can't chat long, I've got eyes on something"}},
{"GREETING","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=recent_human_contact",{"Hi, hi, you're not the only one, I just saw somebody else","Hi- shh, there's people around, I don't know who they are","Hey, did you see them, too? the others, over there?","Hi -- nice to see you, I'm a little jumpy, there've been strangers about...","Hello, stay close, we're not alone out here"}},
{"GREETING","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=player_armed",{"Whoa- hey, easy with that, I'm friendly, I'm friendly","Hi, hi, I see what you're carrying, I'm no threat, I promise","Hello, uh, that looks heavy, I'm glad it's on my side, is it on my side?","Hey, point that somewhere else, please, hi, I'm not looking for trouble","Hi there, I'm not armed, as you can see, well, you can see","Hello, nice to meet you, don't mind me eyeing your gear","Hey, friend, hello, I assume you know how to use that","Oh, hi, you're well equipped, good, I feel safer, a little","Hello, stranger, hello, I notice you're prepared, that's reassuring, mostly","Hi... sorry, I'm staring, it's the hardware.."}},
